  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Resilience Fund (Cambodia)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Resilience Fund is a partnership initiative that features three core components: 
1) Clearing for Results Phase-IV 
2) A flexible and responsive funding mechanism 
3) A humanitarian window. 
The objective is to strengthen Cambodia&#x2019;s resilience in the context of a fast-changing domestic and regional context. UNDP in partnership with Cambodian Mine Action and Victim Assistance (CMAA) is the key implementing partner.</narrative>
  </description>
